{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12650","headline":"系乐府十二首 贱士吟 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 贱士吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南风发天和，和气天下流。\n能使万物荣，不能变羁愁。\n爲愁亦何尔，自请说此由。\n谄竞实多路，苟邪皆共求。\n尝闻古君子，指以爲深羞。\n正方终莫可，江海有沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}